# Python Hooks

> This file extends the common hooks rule with Python specific content.

## PostToolUse Hooks

Claude Code only — configure in `~/.claude/settings.json`. This Cursor install uses `.cursor/hooks.json` and must not gain a Claude settings file:

- **black/ruff**: Auto-format `.py` files after edit
- **mypy/pyright**: Run type checking after editing `.py` files

## Warnings

- Warn about `print()` statements in edited files (use `logging` module instead)
